# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day23

I prefer studying at home rather than studying somewhere else.

The main reason is that I can concentrate better when I'm in a familiar environment.

For example, I don't have to worry about other people talking or making noise around me.

Another reason is that I can take short breaks whenever I need to.

I can make some coffee, check my schedule, and then get back to studying.

As a result, I feel more comfortable and can study for a longer period of time.

That's why I usually choose to study at home.
